#. module: bf_music_licensing
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/bf_music_licensing/models/music_licence.py:0
msgid ""
"<p><strong>Music licence (%(label)s)</strong></p><p>%(name)s, due on "
"%(due)s</p>"
msgstr ""
"<p><strong>Licence musicale (%(label)s)</strong></p><p>%(name)s — échéance :"
" %(due)s</p>"

#. module: bf_music_licensing
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/bf_music_licensing/models/music_establishment.py:0
msgid ""
"A background music supplier normally holds the supply licences. Check what "
"the subscription covers before billing a duplicate royalty."
msgstr ""
"Un fournisseur de musique d'ambiance détient normalement les licences de "
"fourniture. Vérifier ce que l'abonnement couvre avant de facturer une "
"redevance en double."

#. module: bf_music_licensing
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/bf_music_licensing/models/music_tariff.py:0
msgid ""
"A certified tariff carries its certification date. Without it, there is no "
"way to know from when the adjustment is due (%s)."
msgstr ""
"Un tarif homologué porte sa date d'homologation. Sans elle, on ne sait pas à"
" partir de quand le rajustement est dû (%s)."

#. module: bf_music_licensing
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/bf_music_licensing/models/music_establishment.py:0
msgid ""
"A consumer streaming service used in a business adds to the royalties: its "
"terms of use restrict listening to personal use. Check the service agreement"
" before making a written finding."
msgstr ""
"Un service d'écoute grand public utilisé dans un commerce s'ajoute aux "
"redevances : ses conditions d'utilisation réservent l'écoute à un usage "
"personnel. À vérifier au contrat du service avant d'en faire un constat "
"écrit."

#. module: bf_music_licensing
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:bf_music_licensing.view_music_establishment_form
msgid ""
"A licence period will be created for each missing year since 2020, with its "
"tariff lines. Continue?"
msgstr ""
"Une période de licence sera créée pour chaque année manquante depuis 2020, "
"avec ses lignes de tarif. Continuer?"

#. module: bf_music_licensing
#: model:ir.model.constraint,message:bf_music_licensing.constraint_bf_music_tariff_period_unique
msgid ""
"A period can carry only one line per tariff: the proposed rate and the "
"certified rate live on the same line."
msgstr ""
"Une même période ne peut porter qu'une ligne par tarif : le taux proposé et "
"le taux homologué vivent sur la même ligne."

